lock_sweep/labels        | labels 16 1600000                | pith | go:bench/lock_sweep.go | cargo:bench/lock_sweep_rust
lock_sweep/breaker       | breaker 16 50000000              | pith | go:bench/lock_sweep.go | cargo:bench/lock_sweep_rust
lock_sweep/readfile      | readfile 16 200000               | pith | go:bench/lock_sweep.go | cargo:bench/lock_sweep_rust
metrics_contention/counter | 3 4000000 16 counter           | pith | go:bench/metrics_contention.go | cargo:bench/metrics_contention_rust | { print $NF }
metrics_contention/histogram | 3 4000000 16 histogram       | pith | go:bench/metrics_contention.go | cargo:bench/metrics_contention_rust | { print $NF }
metrics_contention/labels | 3 1000000 16 labels             | pith | go:bench/metrics_contention.go | cargo:bench/metrics_contention_rust | { print $NF }
